<title>ITALY: Italian jobless rate rises to 12.4 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Italian jobless rate rises to 12.4 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following unemployment data in its quarterly report.</p>
<p>    ITALIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Jan 97	 Oct 96	Jan 96</p>
<p>     Pct unemployed		 12.4	  12.2	 12.2</p>
<p>     Number of unemployed (million)  2.81	 2.79	 2.76</p>
</text>
